---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../site.config';
---

<Base title="Contact" description={`Get in touch with ${site.name} about AI and edge security, speaking, advising or mentoring.`}>
  <article class="sheet">
    <aside class="rail"><span class="meta">Contact</span></aside>
    <div class="main">
      <h1>Contact</h1>
      <p class="lede">I would most like to hear from teams securing AI or edge deployments, and from people breaking into security who want a peer to compare notes with.</p>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>Good reasons to write:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Speaking or teaching</strong> on securing AI and agents, zero trust for the edge and private 5G, and explaining security risk to executives.</li>
          <li><strong>Advising</strong> teams deciding how to secure AI workloads, IoT fleets or private networks.</li>
          <li><strong>Collaboration</strong> on security research and open-source labs for AI and edge systems.</li>
          <li><strong>Mentoring</strong> career changers, especially from telecom, sales or support, moving into technical and security roles.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Specific questions get better answers. "How do we keep an on-prem LLM from leaking customer data?" is a great first message.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cards contact-cards">
        <a class="panel" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}><span class="meta">Email</span><h3>{site.email}</h3><p>The best way to reach me.</p></a>
        {site.phone && <a class="panel" href={`tel:${site.phone.replace(/[^0-9+]/g, '')}`}><span class="meta">Phone</span><h3>{site.phone}</h3><p>[When you are reachable, e.g. weekdays 9–5 Pacific]</p></a>}
        {site.bookingUrl && <a class="panel" href={site.bookingUrl}><span class="meta">Calendar</span><h3>Book a time</h3><p>Pick a slot that works for you.</p></a>}
        <a class="panel" href={site.links.linkedin}><span class="meta">LinkedIn</span><h3>Connect</h3><p>Where I share what I am learning each week.</p></a>
        <a class="panel" href={site.links.github}><span class="meta">GitHub</span><h3>Source</h3><p>Code behind the security labs.</p></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
